            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to growing your trucking business, the equipment you choose matters, especially your semi trucks. These vehicles are more than just a means of transportation; they’re workhorses that support your team, protect your cargo, and impact your bottom line.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "But not every semi truck is created equal. Whether you’re managing a local delivery operation, expanding a regional fleet, or launching your first long-haul route, choosing the right truck can make all the difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we understand how high the stakes are. That’s why we created this comprehensive guide to help you <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">explore your options</a>, understand what matters most, and move forward with confidence.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-know-needs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Know Your Needs Before You Shop",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "know-needs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-know-needs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Before you look at <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">specs or compare brands</a>, get clear on your business model. What works for one operation may not suit another. Start by answering these questions:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-know-needs-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "What kind of cargo do you haul most often?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Are your routes mostly local, regional, or cross-country?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "How important are driver comfort and tech features to your business?"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Are you purchasing one truck or building a fleet?"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-know-needs-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Once you understand how the truck will be used, you’ll be better equipped to choose between cab styles, engine types, and overall builds.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-types",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Types of Semi Trucks and What They’re Built For",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "types"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-types-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There are a variety of <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">semi-truck configurations available</a>. Here are the most common types you’ll come across, along with their best use cases.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-types-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "spec",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Day Cab",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Best for:</strong> Local routes, tight loading docks, and city deliveries"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Perks:</strong> Great visibility, tight turning radius, lower weight"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Sleeper Cab",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Best for:</strong> Regional and long-haul freight"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Perks:</strong> Comfortable resting space, improves driver satisfaction and retention"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Extended Sleeper Cab",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Best for:</strong> Team drivers, coast-to-coast runs, premium freight services"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Perks:</strong> Amenities like built-in refrigerators, upgraded mattresses, and storage"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Medium-Duty vs. Heavy-Duty",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Medium-duty trucks</strong> like the International® MV™ Series are designed for delivery and service work within cities and suburbs."
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "<strong>Heavy-duty trucks</strong> such as the International® LT™ Series are built for power and endurance across longer hauls."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-powertrain",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Engine, Transmission, and Fuel Options: What Powers Your Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "powertrain"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-powertrain-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The engine and drivetrain impact everything from fuel efficiency to how much you can haul. Here are a few points to keep in mind.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-powertrain-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Engine Selection",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-powertrain-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Look for engines that offer both <a href=\"https://www.international.com/products/trucks/features/engines-and-powertrains\">power and reliability</a>. The International® A26 engine, for example, is a lightweight option with a strong track record for fuel economy and uptime. The <a href=\"/specifications\">S13 Powertrain</a> is another advanced option that improves fuel efficiency and sustainability for the best performance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-powertrain-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Transmission Type",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-powertrain-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Manual transmission offers full control but requires skilled drivers. On the other hand, Automated Manual Transmission (AMT) blends manual performance with automatic ease, ideal for reducing driver fatigue.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-powertrain-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fuel Type",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-powertrain-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Diesel remains the most common and infrastructure-supported option. Other alternatives like Electric and CNG are growing, but infrastructure and route planning should be carefully considered.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-powertrain-8",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Ready to find the equipment to fit your needs? <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">Check out our inventory to find reliable semi trucks that can help take your business forward.</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-powertrain-9-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-powertrain-9",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
