                                "style": "link"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-comfort",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Comfort, Safety, and Driver Experience",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "comfort"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-comfort-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A semi truck isn’t just a machine; it’s a workspace. Driver satisfaction has a direct impact on productivity and retention. Here are features worth prioritizing:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-comfort-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Advanced Driver Assistance Systems (ADAS) for lane assist and collision mitigation"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Ergonomic seating and cabin layout"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Telematics integration for tracking performance, fuel use, and diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Climate control and quiet cabin design for comfort in Florida heat"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-comfort-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International proudly offers trucks with these features and more, supporting both your drivers and your bottom line.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-mistakes",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Avoiding Costly Mistakes When Buying a Semi Truck",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "mistakes"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-mistakes-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Even experienced fleet managers can make missteps when upgrading or expanding. Here are some common pitfalls:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-mistakes-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "feature2",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Only focusing on price",
                        "intro": "Lower upfront costs can lead to higher long-term expenses.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Skipping after-sales support",
                        "intro": "Always choose a dealer that offers dependable <a href=\"/parts\">parts</a> and <a href=\"/service\">service</a> options.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Ignoring warranty and maintenance plans",
                        "intro": "These can make or break your ROI.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Failing to test drive",
                        "intro": "You need to feel how it handles under your specific conditions.",
                        "points": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-right-choice",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Making the Right Choice with Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "right-choice"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-right-choice-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "You don’t need to make this decision alone. Our team at Sun State International is here to help you weigh your options, compare models, and find the right solution for your business. As Florida’s trusted <a href=\"/\">International® truck dealer</a>, we combine expert guidance with top-tier inventory and a commitment to service that doesn’t end after the sale. <a href=\"/store/inventory?condition=new\">Explore our available models and discover which truck is right for your fleet.</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-right-choice-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "browse-new-trucks",
                        "label": "See Our Inventory"
                      },
                      {
                        "ctaId": "contact-us",
                        "label": "Contact Us",
                        "style": "secondary"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
